THIRD-PARTY DATA (not covered by the MIT grant above)

Concept data under `public/ontology/` is derived from Open English WordNet,
licensed CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), itself
derived from Princeton WordNet under the WordNet Licence. Attribution is owed
to both the Open English WordNet team and Princeton WordNet.

Relation data under `public/relations/` (when it ships) is derived from
ConceptNet 5, compiled by the Commonsense Computing Initiative. Only assertions
that ConceptNet itself tags `cc:by/4.0` are used, so the operative licence for
that material is CC BY 4.0; ConceptNet's own requested credit block ships with
it regardless. CC BY-SA 4.0 s3(b)(3) forbids imposing different terms on such
material, so it is carved out here explicitly.

Full notices, and a statement of the changes made:
  - docs/ATTRIBUTION.md
  - public/ontology/LICENSE.txt   (ships with the WordNet data)
  - public/relations/LICENSE.txt  (ships with the ConceptNet data)

The MIT licence above conveys only what this project owns. It does not, and
cannot, relicense the WordNet- or ConceptNet-derived data.
